#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Smuggler"
msgstr "Kaçakçı"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Smuggler"
msgstr "Kaçakçı"

#. ~ Profession (male Smuggler) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Ever since the heat (both climate and police presence) got too bad in Miami,"
" you found a niche running all sorts of tax-free goods into New England.  "
"You're used to outrunning the cops, but now both the pigs and your clientele"
" want your brains instead of your product."
msgstr ""
"Miami'de hem iklim hem de polis varlığı çok kötüleştiğinden beri, New "
"England'a her türlü vergisiz malı sokarak bir niş buldun. Polislerden "
"kaçmaya alışkınsın, ama şimdi hem polisler hem de müşterilerin ürünün yerine"
" beynini istiyor."

#. ~ Profession (female Smuggler) description
#: data/json/professions.json
