#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Monster Hunter"
msgstr "Canavar Avcısı"

#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Monster Hunter"
msgstr "Canavar Avcısı"

#. ~ Profession (male Monster Hunter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"With the fall of civilization, you took to living off the land and grew into"
" a competent hunter.  The abominations that thrive in this new world may not"
" be good eating, but their hides and bones make for quite practical "
"trophies."
msgstr ""
"Medeniyetin çöküşüyle birlikte, doğada yaşamaya başladın ve yetenekli bir "
"avcı oldun. Bu yeni dünyada gelişen iğrenç yaratıklar iyi birer yiyecek "
"olmayabilir, ancak derileri ve kemikleri oldukça pratik ganimetler yapar."

#. ~ Profession (female Monster Hunter) description
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"With the fall of civilization, you took to living off the land and grew into"
" a competent hunter.  The abominations that thrive in this new world may not"
" be good eating, but their hides and bones make for quite practical "
