"This bowl is covered in cartoon dogs and a logo that reads 'Paw Patrol'."
msgstr ""
"Bu kase, çizgi film köpekler ve 'Paw Patrol' yazan bir logo ile kaplıdır."

#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
