#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "dilophosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "dilophosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "dilophosaurus zombi"
msgstr[1] "dilophosaurus zombileri"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'dilophosaurus zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"The shuffling corpse of a medium-sized dinosaur with sharp teeth and two "
"prominent bony crests on its head, with ragged strips of ripped flesh "
"hanging down like a frill."
msgstr ""
"Orta boy bir dinozorun keskin dişlere ve başında iki belirgin kemikli tepeye"
" sahip sürüklenen cesedi, yırtılmış et parçaları bir fırfır gibi aşağı "
"sarkıyor."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "ceratosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "ceratosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "ceratosaurus zombi"
msgstr[1] "ceratosaurus zombileri"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'ceratosaurus zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"This zombie is enormous, scaly, and studded with bony spikes; it moves with "
"horrible speed.  Its colorful horns are worn and wet with filth and its "
"bright scales and bone spikes have taken a beating."
msgstr ""
"Bu zombi devasa, pullu ve kemikli dikenlerle kaplı; korkunç bir hızla "
"hareket ediyor. Renkli boynuzları yıpranmış ve pislikle ıslanmış, parlak "
"pulları ve kemik dikenleri darbe almış."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "spinosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "spinosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "spinosaurus zombi"
msgstr[1] "spinosaurus zombileri"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'spinosaurus zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid ""
"Enormous putrid dinosaur corpse with a ferocious crocodile-like head, oozing"
" black eyes, and a tattered sail on its back."
msgstr ""
"Korkunç timsah benzeri bir kafaya, sızan siyah gözlere ve sırtında yırtık "
"bir yelkene sahip devasa çürümüş dinozor cesedi."

#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
msgid "torvosaurus zombie"
msgid_plural "torvosaurus zombies"
msgstr[0] "torvosaurus zombi"
msgstr[1] "torvosaurus zombileri"

#. ~ Description for {'str': 'torvosaurus zombie'}
#: data/mods/DinoMod/monsters/zed-dinosaur.json
